    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present number 4 The Old School House- A spacious 1 bedroom, 1-bathroom, own door apartment. Ideally situated in the heart of Saggart Village, this property enjoys every convenience on its doorstep. A host of local amenities including shops, cafes, restaurants, schools and leisure facilities are all within walking distance, while the nearby LUAS provides quick and easy access to Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nBright & airy living accommodation of c. 47 sqm compromises of entrance hallway with hot press, open plan living/dining area that leads to a private patio area, fully fitted kitchen, double bedroom and main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nNumber 4 The Old School House comes to the market as a blank canvas with no onward chain, it has been recently painted from top to bottom and has plenty of additional features such as generous living space, electric heating, fully fitted kitchen, spacious bedroom and ample parking.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor, this gem ticks all the boxes. This charming apartment provides an excellent opportunity for buyers to put their own stamp on a home and create a stylish living space tailored to their taste. Presented as a true blank canvas, this apartment offers enormous potential for first-time buyers, investors and those looking to downsize. With no onward chain and an unbeatable location, the property is ready for its next owner to transform it into a superb home or investment opportunity. \r\n\r\nAdditional features: \r\nC. 47 sqm \r\nBER D\r\n1 Bed / 1 Bath \r\nOwn Door Apartment\r\nFreshly painted throughout \r\nNice spacious living \r\nEntrance hallway \r\nOpen plan living/dining area \r\nFully fitted kitchen \r\nLarge double bedroom \r\nMain family bathroom \r\nElectric heating \r\nAmple parking \r\nNo onward chain \r\nBlank canvas opportunity \r\nPrime location in the heart of Saggart Village \r\nHighly sought-after development \r\nJust minutes from shops, cafes, local amenities & the LUAS \r\nIdeal for a wide range of buyers \r\n\r\nDirections: From the N7, take the exit for Saggart and continue towards Saggart Village. Proceed through the village and The Old School House development is located in the centre of the village on the left-hand side."
      },
      {
